raña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","review_id":"aAqgZXZYzJQ_sOyOSu42cQ","date":"2019-12-10T18:57:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.936499834060669,"text_excerpt":"The breakfast I had here was so good! Pecan and praline waffle with eggs n bacon(sausage patties option available). My date had strawberry shortcake french toast with bruleed sugar and thoroughly enjoyed it. I also got to sample the city grits. The combination of cheese, grits, bacon and onion was phenomenal. Everyone I came in contact with their was smiling and service was quick and friendly. The food alone would have me return, but it's nice to find a place that also makes you want to sit down and enjoy their food instead of taking it to go. They had many options available, so I'm definitely looking forward to my next trip."},{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","review_id":"V3SUKagYielrAmgDeqS_GQ","date":"2020-02-22T19:20:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9342970848083496,"text_excerpt":"When I make my annual trek down to NOLA for Mardi Gras season, I always eat breakfast here. Since I started going three years ago, this spot is my first-day breakfast and the one I eat on the way out. I did that again this year. This location has a parking lot. It is small, but I've managed to grab a spot every time except for one. The restaurant looks like a little country house. It is always very clean and the decor is charming and cute. Love the mimosas here. I had a blueberry lemon on the first visit and the Strawberry St.Germain the second. Both were delicious. I think I prefer the flavours in the blueberry lemon personally, though. I got my usual both times, the lobster and brie ome..."},{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","review_id":"7KAOENFE8Rp7-Iw24vtmlA","date":"2015-04-01T20:51:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9319776296615601,"text_excerpt":"HALLELUJAH! This place! YUM! My boyfriend had been here a few times and I had never, so one lazy morning lying in bed we decided to grab brunch because it was a rare beautiful late winter day. My only gripes are that is was one of those \"lets maximize on space and place tables EVERYWHERE\" type restaurants. Still, it was comfortable enough for my boyfriend and I to dine in. The Hosts are also blonde dumb about wait times which I don't necessarily blame on them. They quote you 15-20 minutes and its accurate but you wait longer and its because the patrons are in the lakeview area and linger at their table well after finishing meals. We sat next to a group who were eating when we arrived and ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","photo_id":"CSMzLXauH4ZKj55Vh8CpMg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CSMzLXauH4ZKj55Vh8CpMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7948735952377319},{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","photo_id":"TDIFHfm7QN2HNlfBQmMb6Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TDIFHfm7QN2HNlfBQmMb6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7875640392303467},{"business_id":"YxZJXr_a-Oie6O-Lk9C6zA","photo_id":"vGWn70URwpf24mWufZX